er offers every category; the survey''s What remains records it. || BONUSES: +4 initiative, +3 parry, +5 automatic dodge (automatic_dodge), +1 roll at levels 1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13 and 15 (level 1 in combat, the rest at_level), +1 save vs poison (toxins_poisons), +4 vs possession, four attacks per melee (attacks_base 4) +1 at levels 5 and 11. The +1 to strike at levels 2, 5, 8 and 11 is with the TK Pulse only, so it is prose in that ability. The immunity to psychic sensitive powers is prose. || PSIONICS: minor physical psychic; Telekinetic Lift granted, Levitation or Telekinetic Leap, and Resist Fatigue or Impervious to Cold as two starting groups. The TK Pulse is a natural ability with no I.S.P. cost. || Not stored: no money and no equipment are printed. Average Level of Experience 1D6+4 is for NPCs and is in GM Notes."
